ommand_check":"None found. The order contains one command, the exemption of one named employee; it prescribes no report, procedure, delegation, appropriation or continuing duty. The compulsory-retirement rule it excepts comes from section 204 and the retirement statutes, which are independent of this order, so when the exemption's period ended no command of this order remained to continue.","savings_check":"The exemption is exhausted at 1941-09-30; its accrued effects (service, pay, retirement credit) are separate from the order and are stated as transferred_or_accrued. No later exemption order for the same person is found by the name search.","scope_check":"Scope: one named employee, James E. Harper (Chief, Employee Relations Section, Division of Personnel, Treasury Department). The dossier inventory has one whole-order clause (characters 0-722 of the registered file, the recital and the operative sentence); the signature and date line follow it in the full 757-character text. Nothing in the text is outside that clause, so no inventory correction is needed."}

